@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Hello: 200, plain text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hello

### Shops: 200, JSON array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops
Accept: application/json

### Shop detail: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops/1
Accept: application/json

### Shop 1 menu: Chicken Rice; no shop 2 products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops/1/menu
Accept: application/json

### Shop 2 menu: Coffee and unavailable Lemon Tea; no shop 1 products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops/2/menu
Accept: application/json

### Unknown shop: 404 (provided this ID is absent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops/999999/menu
Accept: application/json

### Invalid ID representation: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops/not-a-number/menu
Accept: application/json

### Requires manual menu-test-fixtures.sql in the CURRENT target DB: empty shop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops/9001/menu
Accept: application/json

### Requires manual fixtures: Drinks, Main Courses, Desserts; empty lists retained
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shops/9002/menu
Accept: application/json
